{
  "name": "@dv/sglang-omni",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Provider plugin sglang-omni of DreamVerse for speech models on local SGLang-Omni servers: registers one dvModels entry per configured model (fish-audio-drama-3) for task t2a, with its speaker and extra parameter schema, request validation, served-model check and prompt skill.",
